{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">旅遊巴落客驚現搞笑又離譜的「落大閘」場面！網絡近日瘋傳一段影片，一輛旅遊巴在停泊落客期間，有熱心乘客特別鑽入車底的行李廂位置，協助同行友人搬運行李篋。不料司機疑似視線被阻或未有看清，竟然順手閂上行李廂閘門，當場將該名乘客誤鎖在行李廂內部。 </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-05-11h23m20s366.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026uQwPWoe42G1791170854.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-05-11h23m20s366.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">幸運的是，旁邊其他市民與乘客見狀即時出聲提醒，司機驚覺後急急慌忙重新開啟閘門，該名乘客才得以順利爬出離開。 </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-05-11h23m25s270.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RJzzRuUQOQ1791170867.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-05-11h23m25s270.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">相關片段引來大批網民圍觀及爆笑熱議，眾人紛紛留言打趣與抽水：</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">幽默抽水派：有網民笑言畫面極具喜感，搞笑留言：「人哋玩落大閘」、「達哥接班人，禾味落車喎～」。 </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">實用建言派：亦有網民針對安全隱患提出建議，指：「行李廂內應該增設CCTV及救命鐘」，以防止同類誤鎖事件再次發生。 </p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T03:38:24.192596+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}